<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy information for the Round Colour Designs website."><PageHero eyebrow="Website information" title="Privacy policy" intro="How information is handled when you use this website or contact the studio."/><section class="section"><article class="container prose legal"><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>The website may direct you to WhatsApp or telephone. Information you send through those services is handled through the relevant service and used to respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>Website forms</h2><p>The current enquiry form prepares a WhatsApp message in your browser and does not submit information to a website database.</p><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>No analytics or advertising cookies are intentionally configured in this internal prototype. This policy must be updated before analytics, embedded services or marketing tools are introduced.</p><h2>Temporary content</h2><p>Some project information, testimonials and photographs are placeholders for internal review and will be replaced before public launch.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this website can be raised through the contact details published on the Contact page.</p></article></section></BaseLayout>
